{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43130","headline":"洛阳道 · 郑渥","name":"洛阳道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客亭门外路东西，多少喧腾事不齐。\n杨柳惹鞭公子醉，苎麻掩泪鲁人迷。\n通宵尘土飞山月，是处经营夹御堤。\n顷刻知音几存殁，半回依约认轮蹄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑渥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}